  Line item. One product row: image, title x quantity, variant, selling plan,
  and visible properties. With prices on, also the price, unit price, and
  line-level discounts. Use inside a full-width table, one include per line.
  Inputs, reset after use:
    item             a Shopify line_item
    item_quantity    quantity text, e.g. 2 or '1 of 2' (defaults to item.quantity)
    item_show_price  true to show price, unit price, and line discounts
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- if item.product.title != blank -%}
  {%- assign item_title = item.product.title -%}
{%- elsif item.title_without_variant != blank -%}
